<title>BELGIUM: CYCLING-LEADING POSITIONS IN GHENT SIX-DAY RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LEADING POSITIONS IN GHENT SIX-DAY RACE.</headline>
<dateline>GHENT, Belgium 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after</p>
<p>the first day of the Ghent six-day cycling race on Tuesday:</p>
<p> 1. Bruno Risi/Kurt Betschart (Switzerland)		  115</p>
<p>points</p>
<p> 2. Andreas Kappes/Carsten Wolf (Germany)		     76</p>
<p> 3. Silvio Martinello/Marco Villa (Italy)		     73</p>
<p>4. Matthew Gilmore/Jakob Piil Storm (Australia/Denmark)  64</p>
<p> 5. Etienne De Wilde/Adriano Baffi (Belgium/Italy)	  62</p>
<p> 6. Jens Veggerby/Jimmi Madsen (Denmark)			71</p>
</text>
